<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND SCOREBOARD VS ZIMBABWE--DAY THREE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND SCOREBOARD VS ZIMBABWE--DAY THREE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the England</p>
<p>innings at the close of the third day of the first test against</p>
<p>Zimbabwe at Queen's Club on Friday.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe 376</p>
<p>England (overnight 48-1):</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw Olonga			56</p>
<p> M.Atherton lbw P.Strang		  16</p>
<p> A.Stewart lbw P.Strang		   48</p>
<p> N.Hussain not out			 101</p>
