<p> J.Crawley not out			  51</p>
<p> Extras (b4 lD2 w1 nb14)		  21</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets, 108 overs) 306</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-48 2-92 3-160 4-180</p>
<p>To bat: Robert Croft, Darren Gough, Chris Silverwood, Alan</p>
<p>Mullally, Phil Tufnell.</p>
<p>Bowling: Streak 23-6-52-0 (nb7), B.Strang 17-5-54-0 (nb1),</p>
<p>P.Strang 37-10-83-3, Olonga 17-1-72-1 (nb6 w1), Whittall</p>
